    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Edge caese:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Even If <b>One day</b> is logged with New Employee Code show New Code in Attendance Report</li>
	<li>Time sheet: User works 4 hours on Old assignment and 4 hours on New</li>
	<li>Role Transition use case- Promotion of an employee from manager to partner (on old assignment)</li>
	<li>Roles-wise testing: Partner, Other Partner, Additional Partner, Manager and Staff</li>
	<li>Employee lifecycle: New code is linked to the old code</li>
	<li>Previous data will be accessible using the previous employee code and the employee’s name.</li>
	<li>Profile change with promotion</li>
	<li><b>Where will this change reflect:</b>  Report, Client/assignment, Team , Promotion/Rejoining and Human Resources</li>
	<li><b>All Dropdowns</b> where staff code appears in case of promotion and rejoining</li>
	<li><b>Dashboard</b> where this change will reflect</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

