    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Modification points:</b></p>

<p>1.Fill timesheet in bulk for one week (Monday to saturday) and save the data successfully. -</p>

<p><a href="http://22.by/" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">22</a>.  by default, timesheet for 6 days (1 week) should be displayed if user did not save 1 week timesheet on that case. -</p>



<p><b>New points:</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>When the user clicks the <b>Save</b> button. The button should be <b>disabled</b> to prevent multiple submissions.</li>
	<li>When a <b>week timesheet fields</b> is displayed:
	<ul>
		<li>The <b>'To Date'</b> field should automatically select the upcoming <b>Saturday date</b>.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>If the user manually selects <b>Sunday date</b> as the 'To Date':
	<ul>
		<li>The <b>timesheet field section</b> for <b>Sunday date</b> should be displayed accordingly.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

