    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Wherever a filter is available, there should be a 'Reset Filter' button displayed after applying the filter.</p>

<p>Filter Lists:-</p>

<p>Admin, Partner, Manager Role</p>

<ol>
	<li>Apply Leave&gt; Team Application (for Partner as well)</li>
	<li>Timesheet (for Partner as well)</li>
	<li>Timesheet tab&gt;Team Timesheet</li>
	<li>Timesheet tab&gt;Submitted Timesheet (for Partner &amp; Manager as well)</li>
	<li>Report&gt;Assignment Time report</li>
	<li>Report&gt;Attendance (for Partner &amp; Manager as well)</li>
	<li>Report&gt;Independence</li>
	<li>Report&gt;Team Timesheet Report</li>
	<li>Report&gt;Timesheet Report (for Partner &amp; Manager as well)</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

