    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Applicable for Admin and Partner role</b><br/>
1.Check that Admin and Partner will be able to access the Independence tab inside the Report section. - <b>Pass</b><br/>
2.Check that All Pending and Submitted (status) Independence Confirmations should be listed.<br/>
3.Check that Admin and Partner will be able to filter the listed data basis of team member, assignment Id &amp; status. -<b>Pass</b><br/>
4.Check that Status and Submitted Date columns will have ascending and descending sorting available. - <b>Pass</b><br/>
5.Check that when downloading the report in Excel all data is accurate &amp; correct. - <b>Pass</b><br/>
6.Check all validations on filter fields. - <b>Pass</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Name column will show inactive &amp; active both the user type - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Check for staff code after promotion and rejoined. - <b>Fail ( it shows old code)</b></li>
	<li>Check that 'Search' &amp; 'Show entries' &amp; 'column visibility' functionality is available or not. - <b>Pass</b></li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

