        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Check that in the dashboard tab for below mentioned boxes entries should be shown from ‘January to Current month’, it should not show from ‘April to current month’ &amp; it will be applicable for Staff, Manager &amp; Partner role;</p>

<ul>
	<li>Total Working Days (submitted working days of current year from jan till date)</li>
	<li>Total Travel Days (submitted travel entry of current year from jan till date)</li>
	<li>Approved Leaves (in case of EL &amp; CL - only approved leaves will be captured in dashboard of current year from jan till date)</li>
</ul>




