    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>For Partner, Manager, and Staff IDs</b></p>

<p><b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Dashboard'</b></li>
	<li>Locate the following boxes:
	<ul>
		<li><b>Total Working Days</b></li>
		<li><b>Total Travel Days</b></li>
		<li><b>Approved Leaves</b></li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ol>




<p><font color="#bf2600">Use the attendance data as a reference to cross-check the count</font></p>

<p>1.The <b>count displayed</b> in each of the three boxes (<b>Working Days</b>, <b>Travel Days</b>, and <b>Approved Leaves</b>) should be <b>accurate</b>.</p>

<p>2.Ensure the data is displayed correctly after clicking the checkbox</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
