    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-17079"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348"
                id="word_commented_712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348">
                    Pooja Kumari (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">14/May/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-17079"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" data-account-id="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" accountid="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" rel="noreferrer">Shahid Raza</a> In case of casual leave ‘Approved Leaves’ box on dashboard covers the created leave as well if it is submitted from timesheet.</p>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15222" alt="image-20250514-083535.png" height="112" width="1273" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15223" alt="image-20250514-083605.png" height="268" width="452" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<ol>
	<li>Also in case of Exam leave it is counting 2nd &amp; 4th Saturday &amp; Sundays as well which in result shows incorrect count. Please check this as well</li>
	<li>The approved leave box also captures the count of rejected leaves;</li>
</ol>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15252" alt="image-20250515-051534.png" height="73" width="798" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15253" alt="image-20250515-051616.png" height="156" width="335" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-17368"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286"
                id="word_commented_712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286">
                    Atishay Jain (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">20/May/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-17368"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" class="user-hover" rel="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" data-account-id="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" accountid="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" rel="noreferrer">Pooja Kumari</a> no changes are required to be done in the count for Approved leaves, as discussed with VSA.</p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
