    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>For Admin, partner, manager and staff IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:-</b><br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on '<b>Report tab</b>' dropdown.</p>

<p>1.Please ensure that all sub-tabs under the 'Report' tab are arranged in ascending alphabetical order.</p>



<p>Test data while testing;</p>

<p>In admin login</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15054" alt="image-20250508-110744.png" height="593" width="413" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>In Partner login;</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/15053" alt="image-20250508-111006.png" height="247" width="251" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

