    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ol>
	<li>Test for All Roles</li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li>Staff Role - Mon-Fri (sat holiday to be selected)</li>
	<li>Rest Role - Mon-Sat</li>
	<li>Partner Role -= all 3 types</li>
</ul>


<p>Partners and Managers can select Off/Holiday client only on 2nd &amp; 4th Saturdays and official holidays.</p>

<p>Staff can select Off/Holiday client on all Saturdays and official holidays.</p>

<p>Check for all 3 Partner Types</p>

<ul>
	<li>Mixed leave scenario</li>
	<li>Approve flows</li>
	<li>Rejection flows</li>
</ul>


<p>Observations for <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a> </p>
