            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Description</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>For Admin and Partner IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Report' dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on 'Independence'.</li>
</ol>


<p>1.All Pending and Submitted Independence Confirmations should be listed.<br/>
2.Admin and Partner users should be able to access the Independence tab inside the Report section.<br/>
3.Admin and Partner users should be able to filter the listed data.<br/>
4.Status and Submitted Date columns should have ascending and descending sort icons only.<br/>
5.Download the report in Excel and ensure that all data is correct.<br/>
6.Apply and verify validation on filter fields.</p>

<p>7.verify staff code after promotion and rejoined.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

