        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13966" alt="image-20250405-102446.png" height="483" width="1275" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p>attachment should be visible here, while opening the notification</p>



<p><b>For Admin Only</b></p>

<p><b>Steps:-</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Notification List'</b> dropdown</li>
	<li>Click on <b>'Add Announcement'</b></li>
	<li>Fill the form and click the <b>Send</b> button</li>
</ol>




<p><b>For Admin, partner, manager and staff</b></p>

<p><b>Steps:-</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Notification List'</b> dropdown</li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li>An <b>Attachment</b> column has been added. Now, the user should be able to <b>view the attachment</b> here. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>After clicking the <b>Title hyperlink</b>, the <b>Attachment</b> should also be visible. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Download the <b>Notification Report in Excel</b> and ensure the data appears <b>correctly</b> in the Excel file. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li><b>Ascending and descending icons</b> should be shown <b>only</b> on the <b>Date</b> column. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>ensure the <b>Attachment</b> in the mail - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>After click on send button, send button should be disabled so that user cannot click multiple time - <b>Pass</b></li>
</ul>


<p><b>QA Points:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Tested with more than 5MB, proper validation is showing. File Limit.</li>
	<li>Multiple files are not accepting while uploading, only one at a time.</li>
	<li>Tested with png, pdf, jpeg, jpg, xls, xlsx.</li>
	<li>Tested with all the roles.</li>
	<li>Announcement will be created only by Admin role.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

