    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Currently there are two places where there is a requirement of OTP for closure:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Assignment Closure</li>
	<li>Confirmation Module closure</li>
</ol>




<p>Who can initiate the closure?</p>

<ol>
	<li>Assignment - Lead Partner and Other Partner</li>
	<li>Confirmation - Lead Partner, Other Partner, Additional Partner, Admin and Manager</li>
</ol>




<p><b><em>Requirement:</em></b></p>

<p>Requirement is for OTP to be received by other partner also in order to initiate and finalize the closure of Assignment and Confirmation module.</p>

<ol>
	<li>Assignment:
	<ol>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by Lead Partner, OTP will be sent to Lead Partner only. - <b>QA Pass</b></li>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by Other Partner, OTP will be sent to Other Partner only. - <b>QA Pass</b></li>
	</ol>
	</li>
</ol>


<p><ins><b><em>Note:</em></b></ins> <b><em>- No right to Additional Partner for Assignment closure. so, no OTP requirement to Additional Partner.</em></b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Confirmation Module
	<ol>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by Lead Partner, OTP will be sent to Lead Partner only. - <b>QA Pass</b></li>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by Other Partner, OTP will be sent to Other Partner only. <b>QA Pass</b></li>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by any Additional Partner, OTP will be sent to that Additional Partner only.<b>QA Pass</b></li>
		<li>In case closure is initiated by Admin and Manager, admin and manager will select the partner using the dropdown to whom OTP will be sent. OTP will be sent to the selected partner. - <b>QA Pass</b></li>
	</ol>
	</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Comments</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-15715"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3"
                id="word_commented_712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3">
                    Simmi Puri (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">11/Apr/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-15715"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a> <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" class="user-hover" rel="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" data-account-id="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" accountid="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" rel="noreferrer">Pooja Kumari</a> </p>

<ul>
	<li>2 OTP use cases - Assignment and Confirmation module - rule for each differ</li>
	<li>3 partner types</li>
</ul>


<p>Assignment </p>

<ul>
	<li>Lead and Other have the right to initiate closure and resp partner to receive OPT</li>
	<li>Additional Partner can not</li>
</ul>


<p>Confirmation Module</p>

<ul>
	<li>All 3 partners can receive OPT</li>
	<li>Admin and Manager select the partner using the dropdown to whom OTP will be sent &gt;  OTP will be sent to the selected partner only</li>
</ul>

        </td></tr>
            </table>
