    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>If Employee gets rejoins then ‘Joining date’ gets updated from old to new. The column name is Joining date in which after rejoining it shows the rejoining date. <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a> <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" data-account-id="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" accountid="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" rel="noreferrer">Simmi Puri</a> Please suggest the correct date which should be shown;</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13469" alt="image-20250320-093142.png" height="750" width="1456" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>In the above case, actual joining date was 15th Nov 2024.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

