    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>In the client login, Dashboard tab is showing which shows ‘observation’ &amp; ‘actionable’ data. This dashboard should be based on Tickets raised or type of ticket raised or status. If Dashboard has to be shown, then data is to be based on Tickets.</p>

