        <tr id="comment-body-14509"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A2113f4b8-c916-4a17-85a8-edb676734954" class="user-hover" rel="712020:2113f4b8-c916-4a17-85a8-edb676734954" data-account-id="712020:2113f4b8-c916-4a17-85a8-edb676734954" accountid="712020:2113f4b8-c916-4a17-85a8-edb676734954" rel="noreferrer">Prashant Pandey</a> <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c" class="user-hover" rel="712020:ec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c" data-account-id="712020:ec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c" accountid="712020:ec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c" rel="noreferrer">Gaurav Kumar Amoli</a> From, client Id, Filter &amp; count is removed correctly but in the super admin login also ‘<b>Select User Responsible</b>’ &amp; ‘<b>Select Reviewer Responsible</b>’ is to be removed as it is not valid for Ticketing flow.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-14530"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:ec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c"
                id="word_commented_712020:ec65ddf4-b63b-4485-8515-cec93526225c"
