                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">18/Mar/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-14530"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" class="user-hover" rel="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" data-account-id="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" accountid="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" rel="noreferrer">Pooja Kumari</a> The super admin can bypass any permission, so he can see the counts and filters.<br/>
However Ticketing module is nothing but the observation module so If such a requirement to remove counts and filters even for superadmin  is  a priority to remove we would need to find some way</p>
