    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>For Admin and Partner IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:-</b><br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Client/Assignmnet' dropdown.<br/>
2.Click on 'Add Assignment.<br/>
3.fill data and click submit button</p>

<ol>
	<li>All mandatory fields are required.</li>
	<li>Std Cos, Est Cost and Fees of The Asignment should contain only digits, not text.</li>
	<li>The Lead Partner, Other Partner, and Additional Partner cannot be the same</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
