    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Show an alert message before sending the OTP if the confirmation and independence forms have not been submitted/Closed </p>

<p>Description:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Close the assignment when all confirmation (except draft) is done</li>
	<li>Check if Independence for the assignment is submitted - If Not</li>
	<li>Do not enable assignment closure - Validation Check</li>
</ul>


<p>Message says ‘are you sure’ without informing user that confirmation or independence is Not Submitted <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a> </p>

<p><div class="embeddedObject"><object classid="clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B" codebase="https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab" data="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13039?stream=true" height="1392" type="video/quicktime" width="2768" ><param name="data" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13039?stream=true"/><param name="src" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13039?stream=true"/><param name="type" value="video/quicktime"/><embed height="1392" pluginspage="https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/" src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13039?stream=true" type="video/quicktime" width="2768" /></object></div></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
