    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-14932"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3"
                id="word_commented_712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3">
                    Simmi Puri (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">27/Mar/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-14932"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>User can be made active/inactive only if user is in the system - does not have a leaving date<br/>
If user Rejoins then again active/inactive till he has a leaving date </p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
