    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Admin login</p>

<p><b>Steps: 1</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Dashboard'.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Team Member Box'.</li>
	<li>Click on the Team Member Name hyperlink.</li>
	<li>fill data and click submit button</li>
</ol>




<p>Admin login</p>

<p><b>Steps: 2</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Dashboard'.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Team Member Box'.</li>
	<li>Click on the Add Teammember.</li>
	<li>fill data and click submit button</li>
</ol>


<p><b>We have to test below points</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>All mandatory fields are required. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Profile picture should be in .jpg, .jpeg, or .png format. - Tested with (pdf, csv, docx, xlsx, pptx, txt, zip, exe, mov, jpg, jpeg &amp; png) - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Personal Email ID should be valid. - <b>Pass</b> (validation is only related to ‘@' and '.’)</li>
	<li>Mobile Number should contain only digits, not text. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Emergency Mobile Number should contain only digits, not text. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Date of Birth should not be in the future. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Aadhaar Number should contain only digits, not text. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>PAN Card Number should be valid. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Mother's Mobile Number should contain only digits, not text. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Father's Mobile Number should contain only digits, not text. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Bank Account Number should contain only digits, not text.</li>
	<li>Joining Date should not be in the future. - <b>Pass</b></li>
	<li>Leaving Date should not be in the future. - <b>Pass</b></li>
</ol>


<p><b>Note</b>; Mobile no. column does not have any limit validation keeping in mind the foreign clients</p>

<p>Also, no limits over bank account number and mobile number confirmed by Atishay</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
