    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>For Partner, Manager, and Staff IDs only.</p>

<h4><a name="Step1%3AApplyLeave"></a><b>Step 1: Apply Leave</b></h4>

<ul>
	<li>Log in using <b>Manager</b> or <b>Staff</b> ID.</li>
	<li>Apply for leave through the application.</li>
</ul>


<h4><a name="Step2%3AApproverNotification"></a><b>Step 2: Approver Notification</b></h4>

<ul>
	<li>The <b>Approver (Partner)</b> will receive a <b>notification email</b> regarding the leave request.</li>
</ul>


<h4><a name="Step3%3AAccessingtheLeaveRequest"></a><b>Step 3: Accessing the Leave Request</b></h4>

<ul>
	<li>In the received email, click on the <b>'here' hyperlink</b>.</li>
</ul>


<h4><a name="Step4%3ARedirecttoOpenLeavePage"></a><b>Step 4: Redirect to Open Leave Page</b></h4>

<ul>
	<li>You will be redirected to the <b>Open Leave Page</b>, where you can view the user's applied leave date.</li>
</ul>


<p>TEST= manager - leave created </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12677" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-25 at 12.47.23 PM.png" height="157" width="1122" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Mail Received by Partner Simmi</p>

<p><div class="embeddedObject"><object classid="clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B" codebase="https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab" data="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12678?stream=true" height="1608" type="video/quicktime" width="2342" ><param name="data" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12678?stream=true"/><param name="src" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12678?stream=true"/><param name="type" value="video/quicktime"/><embed height="1608" pluginspage="https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/" src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12678?stream=true" type="video/quicktime" width="2342" /></object></div></p>

