    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>The system will be created by modifying the existing ATR tool; the modification details are mentioned in the confluence document as attached</p>

<p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/wiki/x/AYAcG" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://capitallio.atlassian.net/wiki/x/AYAcG</a> </p>

<p><b>Gaps in the Ticketing System reported by QA</b></p>

<p>Admin login is with Capitall; some tabs are irrelevant - Not a blocker</p>

<ul>
	<li>Dashboard UI text is for ATR BUT d*ata is dynamic and relevant.*</li>
	<li>Admin can select company VAS and Location Delhi </li>
	<li>Can view All Tickets raised and see audit logs too</li>
	<li>Ticket can be raised without assigning User Responsible and Reviewer - which will be Capitall team member</li>
</ul>


<p>Suggestion: Admin Default Ticket tab view should be as per the attachment </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13369" alt="Screenshot 2025-03-18 at 5.51.26 PM.png" width="58.333333333333336%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Customer Journey Map reported in Confluence: <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120209fc66a27a6494528850594383996f286/pages/404520961/Ticketing+System" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://capitallio.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120209fc66a27a6494528850594383996f286/pages/404520961/Ticketing+System</a> </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
