        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Timesheet request page</p>

<ol>
	<li>Partner (simmi) did not get the approval request</li>
	<li>Approval had to be given via superadmin login</li>
</ol>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12414" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-11 at 12.18.20 PM.png" height="315" width="1146" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<ol>
	<li>Action Column is visible when timesheet request status is created</li>
</ol>


<p>But not visible when timesheet request status is approved/rejected etc2. </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12413" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-11 at 12.17.31 PM.png" height="493" width="1219" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
