        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Before starting testing on this task, please connect with me</b></p>

<p><b>For Admin and Partner IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Dashboard'.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Open Assignment Box'.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Assignment ID' hyperlink.</li>
	<li>Go to the Partner List section.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Plus Icon' to add a partner.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>For Admin IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Client' dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on 'Assignment List'.</li>
	<li>Click on the Client Name hyperlink, then click on the Year hyperlink.</li>
	<li>In the Other Partner column, the Plus Icon should not be displayed.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Notifications &amp; Assignment Updates</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>When a partner is added, they will receive a notification. - Pass</li>
	<li>After receiving the notification, the partner should be able to access the Independence Confirmation page through link received email. - Pass</li>
	<li>Through Partner’s ID from portal, partner should be able to access Independence form. - Pass</li>
	<li>The count in the Open Assignment Box should increase after adding a partner to the assignment in the Partner’s Login dashboard. - Pass</li>
	<li>After clicking on the Open Assignment Box, the newly assigned assignment should be visible in the Partner’s Login. - Pass</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Timesheet Functionality for Partners</b><br/>
<b>On the Add Timesheet Page:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>The Partner should be able to create a timesheet for that assignment. - Pass</li>
	<li>The Total Hours should be updated after a timesheet is created. (to be checked in ‘total hour’ column of 'Partner List. - Pass</li>
	<li>The Total Hours should be updated after a timesheet is deleted. - Pass</li>
	<li>The Total Hours should be updated after a timesheet is edited. - Pass</li>
</ol>




