            <p>For Manager Role;</p>

<ol>
	<li>1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th, 6th, 7th, 8th, 9th, 10th passed</li>
</ol>


<p>Manager Role Pooja: Leave applied on 23ed Dec and 27-28th Dec (29th is Sunday) </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12611" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 8.24.24 AM.png" width="58.333333333333336%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12610" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 8.21.09 AM.png" width="58.333333333333336%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12613" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 8.26.48 AM.png" width="58.333333333333336%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>For Staff Role;</p>

<ol>
	<li>1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, 5th, 6th, 7th, 8th, 9th, 10th passed</li>
</ol>


<p>Staff Role </p>

<p>Leave applied for 15th and 17th- able to fill TS</p>

<p><div class="embeddedObject"><object classid="clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B" codebase="https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab" data="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12614?stream=true" height="1608" type="video/quicktime" width="2426" ><param name="data" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12614?stream=true"/><param name="src" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12614?stream=true"/><param name="type" value="video/quicktime"/><embed height="1608" pluginspage="https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/" src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12614?stream=true" type="video/quicktime" width="2426" /></object></div></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12616" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 11.42.40 AM.png" height="120" width="642" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Next window available is 19th </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12615" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 11.45.07 AM.png" height="262" width="673" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Partner Role</p>

<p>Applied for two leaves (with gap) Monday &amp; Thursday </p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12617" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 12.10.36 PM.png" height="411" width="1122" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12618" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 12.11.46 PM.png" width="50%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12619" alt="Screenshot 2025-02-21 at 12.22.17 PM.png" height="581" width="1211" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><b>Discussion points</b></p>

<p>Will calendar be disabled for approved leaves, CL will happen immediately (QA Pass) by EL after approval <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" data-account-id="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" accountid="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" rel="noreferrer">Shahid Raza</a> </p>

<p><b>Holiday</b> - user will select and input (off/holidya) if not worked &amp; will select ‘client’ if worked on that day  - so no change there</p>
