    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="100%" colspan="2" valign="top">
                            <h3 class="formtitle">
                        [VS-389]&nbsp;<a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/browse/VS-389">2.Whenever the year changes, an error appears on the Apply Leave page because the year has to be manually inserted into the database. This needs to be implemented dynamically.</a>
            <span class="subText">
               Created: 04/Jan/25                   &nbsp;Updated: 13/Jan/25

                                                    &nbsp;Resolved: 13/Jan/25
                            </span>
            </h3>
