    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>1.The client wants to fix the issue where, when the user clicks on holidays, the holiday data will default to the current year, and the current year will also be displayed in the dropdown menu.</p>



<p>Steps:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Human Resources' dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Holidays' tab.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

