    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>Before applying the filter, data will be displayed created first ,approved and in the last rejected.</li>
	<li>After applying the filter, the data should be displayed in ascending order by Request date (latest first).</li>
</ul>


<p><b>For Admin IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Human Resources'</b> dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Apply Leave'</b> tab.</li>
	<li>Use the filter to sort and display data.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

