    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>Every <b>Wednesday</b> and <b>Saturday</b>, an email is sent to the Admin containing an Excel report.</li>
	<li>The report includes:
	<ol>
		<li>Users who saved the timesheet but did not submit it.</li>
		<li>Users who never filled out the timesheet.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li>You have to test also for rejoining user on same post and another post ok i have already explained this scenario  with pooja kumari</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
