    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>The box will display the <b>Total Travel Days</b> based on attendance records.</li>
	<li>The total travel days in attendance will be reflected in the <b>Total Travel Days Box</b> on the dashboard.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>For Partner, Manager, and Staff IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Dashboard'</b>.</li>
	<li>Locate and click on the <b>'Total Travel Days Box'</b>.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
