            [
                <font color="#336699">07/Jan/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-12946"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" data-account-id="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" accountid="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" rel="noreferrer">Shahid Raza</a> total travel is not showing correct count;</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12074" alt="image-20250107-080853.png" height="177" width="274" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12073" alt="image-20250107-080929.png" height="309" width="857" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>When user add travel &amp; work for same day &amp; adds travel first then in total travel, it counts ‘T' for that day, but actually it should count 'P’ only in the combination of P+T or T+P.</p>
        </td></tr>
