    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Current status:</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>System is displaying Staff code on the basis of assigned role.</li>
</ul>


<p>Promotion will generate a new employee code </p>

<ol>
	<li>If Manager will promoted to Partner then system will generating the code as a Partner code.</li>
	<li>If Staff will promoted to Partner then  system is generating the  code as a Partner code.</li>
</ol>


<p>New (re-joining) joining date will be displayed in attendance - link old doj with new doj </p>

<ul>
	<li>If user will rejoin then system is displaying the the re-joining date. (new doj)</li>
	<li>If user gets promoted (without exit) then display original doj</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Bug detected</b> </p>

<ul>
	<li>Role is displaying a promoted role after promotion and previous role from the column is converting to newly promoted role.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Demolition use case</b> </p>

<ul>
	<li>Staff can be converted to manager or Partner. Manager can be converted to Partner, Role demotion will not happen.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Admin Role</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Any role can not be converted to Admin</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

