    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>You cannot edit the Total Hour field here.</li>
	<li>The hour field should not be in the format 00:00; it should only accept whole numbers like 0, 1, 2, 3, etc</li>
</ul>


<p><b>For Partner, Manager, and Staff IDs</b><br/>
<b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Human Resources' dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on the 'Timesheet' dropdown and navigate to 'My Timesheet'.</li>
	<li>Click on 'Add Timesheet'.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

