    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Promotion and Rejoining on Other Posts</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>If a user worked on attendance as a manager, the staff code will display as a manager.</li>
	<li>If a user worked on attendance as a partner, the staff code will display as a partner.</li>
	<li>In the joining date column, the newest joining date will be displayed.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Steps:</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the application.</li>
	<li>Click on the <b>'Report'</b> dropdown.</li>
	<li>Click on <b>'Attendance'</b>.</li>
	<li>Locate the <b>Joining Date</b> column.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

