                <tr id="comment-header-12518"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                id="word_commented_712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a">
                    Manasvi Gupta (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">18/Nov/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-12518"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Use this UI for <b>showing tabs</b> while employee fills the form. The difference in size will show the length of a particular section. Blue colour indicates the completion of the step &amp; all the details filled successfully in that section. Red colour shows missing details and Grey shows that none of the field is filled OR the user didn’t even visit that section.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11722" alt="image-20241118-091310.png" width="50%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-12520"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                id="word_commented_712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a">
                    Manasvi Gupta (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">18/Nov/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-12520"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Use this when <b>profile of an employee shows the %age completion</b>. Omit time shown in UI. The circular in progress bar indicates the number of sections (like qualifications, personal, experience, etc)<br/>
Instead of “75% to complete” show “25% completed”. <br/>
If the profile is completed &lt;=45%, show with red colour<br/>
=60% show with yellow colour<br/>
= 80% blue<br/>
=100% green.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11723" alt="image-20241118-091803.png" height="40" width="265" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-12521"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                id="word_commented_712020:37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A37aadcd8-3842-45ac-bf46-84a797d4bf3a">
                    Manasvi Gupta (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">18/Nov/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-12521"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Use this in <b>table</b> indicating %age completion of profile.</p>

<p>We can omit decimals.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11724" alt="image-20241118-092521.png" height="250" width="250" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-14265"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
