            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a> task descrption is not populated, has <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" data-account-id="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" accountid="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" rel="noreferrer">Shahid Raza</a> started work on this?</p>
