        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>List of all the mails users receives</li>
	<li>In-app Notification list</li>
</ul>


<ol>
	<li>Partner receives notification mail once user send Timesheet approval.</li>
	<li>User receives the notification mail when partner approves/rejects Timesheet request.</li>
	<li>All team members receive the mail when creating the new Assignment.</li>
	<li>When assignment gets rejected, user gets email.</li>
	<li>Partner receives notification mail once user send Leave approval.</li>
	<li>User receives the notification mail when partner approves/rejects Leave request.</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
