    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>The date format should be 01-01-2024 on the webpage and 01-01-2024 in Excel. </p>

<p>New bug reported in Date format.DD-MM-YY</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/12907" alt="Screenshot 2025-03-05 at 8.30.01 AM.png" width="50%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>TC: Need to capture where date is inputted in the entire portal </p>

<ol>
	<li>Date in profile Test pass</li>
	<li>Date in Dashboard - holiday list etc  Test pass</li>
	<li>Assignment creation - period start, period end date, deadline Test pass</li>
	<li>assignment <b>Udin Date</b> - QA Pass</li>
	<li>assignment budget Due Date - QA Pass</li>
	<li>Team List - QA Pass</li>
	<li>Team member profile edit page - QA Pass</li>
	<li>Appointment Letter - <font color="#bf2600"><b>Test Pass</b></font></li>
	<li>Apply leave - Qa Pass</li>
	<li>Timesheet  Test pass</li>
	<li>Timesheet Request , Test Pass</li>
	<li>Holiday list (display in dashboard too), Test Pass</li>
	<li>Promotion/Rejoining , Test Pas</li>
	<li>Reports -All tabs  Test pass</li>
	<li>Notification list , Test Pass</li>
	<li>Knowledge base, Test Pass</li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

