    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>When selecting an employee name, start date, and end date check the joining date. </p>

<p>If the End date is before the joining date, a warning message should appear: "You cannot select a date before the joining date. </p>

<p>After submitting the leaving date, the attendance report will be updated by marking entries with a cross sign (X) for all dates following the leaving date. </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

