    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>Admin and partner login will display attendance data</li>
	<li>Admin and partner can export excel reports of all users. </li>
	<li>Admin and partner panel, attendance record should be displayed date-wise, and all dates contain present (P) , absent (A), travel (T), Casual leave (cl), exam leave (EL), holidays (H) And Sunday (O or w)</li>
	<li>Filter functionality on attendance using date like from start date to end date. </li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

