            <p><a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" class="user-hover" rel="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" data-account-id="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" accountid="712020:3bb006a3-fefb-46cb-bba3-303693cb0c73" rel="noreferrer">Shahid Raza</a> <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" data-account-id="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" accountid="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" rel="noreferrer">Simmi Puri</a> currently Absent (A) is not applicable in attendance module also for weekend if filled it shows (OH).</p>
