    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>Admin &amp; Partner can filter data based on ‘Name’, ‘Start Date’, &amp; ‘End Date’ where ‘Start Date’ &amp; ‘End date’ is mandatory</li>
	<li>Validation will be added on start date &amp; end date column as end date cannot be smaller than start date. </li>
	<li>Attendance report can be extracted in excel. </li>
	<li>Cannot select Future start date &amp; end date (filter functionality)</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

