    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Exam leave has an auto-submit functionality: if a user submits timesheets on a weekly basis consistently and then applies for leave, their exam leave timesheet will be automatically submitted in the coming Wednesday.  </p>

<p>Also, if in a week timesheet is filled with Exam leave then it will not be auto-submitted</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

