    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Delete option is not available on the page, admin can not delete the submitted timesheet.</p>

<p>Admin can reject and submit the saved timesheet date.</p>





<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.Click on 'Timesheet dropdown and navigate to 'timesheet.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11698" alt="image-20241113-052128.png" height="477" width="1280" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

