    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>admin can add a second partner (only 1 more partner allowed) to an active assignment</p>

<p>When you map the assignment &gt; add Other Partner</p>

<p><font color="#bf2600">Other Partner can be added Only while creation But there is No way to edit and add Other Partner </font></p>



<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Client/Assignment' dropdown.<br/>
3.click on 'Assignment List'<br/>
4.click on 'hyperlink client name'<br/>
5.click on 'year hyperlink '<br/>
6.Go to Other partner column</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

