    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>You need to apply for exam leave for at least 20 days in a month that includes holidays. After approving the exam leave, check the attendance report to ensure that all holiday dates display 'H' in the attendance</p>

<p>Currently, holidays (H) are not appearing in the attendance record.</p>
            <br/>
