    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>System is displaying validation message if user fill the currency but not amount.</li>
	<li>If user fill the amount but not currency, then user will be able upload the excel file <b>which is a bug.</b></li>
</ul>




<p><span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11493" title="screen-capture (68).webm attached to VS-208" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="screen-capture (68).webm" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="80fa18ba-3b24-4806-86bf-b4a290bfe367" rel="noreferrer">screen-capture (68).webm<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p>validation for blank column :- Pass</p>

<p>Negative amount upload:- Pass</p>
