    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ol>
	<li>Need to add these columns - Security Deposit Provided and Currency &amp; Security Deposit Received and Currency - <font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font></li>
	<li>Need to make purpose of confirmation dynamic as we made it for Subject.</li>
	<li>The debtor field should not be marked compulsory since in case we only want creditor or any other column to be filled then there will be a validation issue. <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/browse/VS-218" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font></a>[https://capitallio.atlassian.net/browse/VS-218|https://capitallio.atlassian.net/browse/VS-218|smart-link]</li>
	<li>On the confirmation page change "Auditor Name" to "Audit Firm Name" - <font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11505" alt="Screenshot 2024-10-21 at 12.02.25 PM.png" height="101" width="697" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>In the attachment there should be an option for other attachment -  <font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font></li>
	<li>Option to add rows for attachment in bank flow - <font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11506" alt="Screenshot 2024-10-21 at 12.04.12 PM.png" width="22.176470588235293%" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>Customer ID should be mentioned in the Responder Flow above. -<font color="#0747a6"><b>QA PASS</b></font></li>
</ol>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

