    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>As of now user gets 2 emails simultaneously 1 for assignment creation and 1 for independence confirmation, so we need to combine them as 1 mail and user will only get 1 mail for creation and confirmation.</p>



<p><b>Whenever a user is added to an assignment:</b> <b>Sample Mail:</b></p>

<p><b>Subject:</b></p>

<p> VSA || New Assignment Allocation || Assignment Name (Assignment Code) || Independence Confirmation</p>

<p><b>Mail Body:</b></p>

<p>Dear Sir/Madam,</p>

<p>This is to inform you that you have been allocated to a new assignment. The details are given here under:</p>

<p><b>Client Name:</b> Mnaoj ( 100006 )</p>

<p><b>Assignment Name:</b> llp (llp1) (MNA100034)</p>

<p><b>Assignment Partner :</b> Harish Vinod Tale (M1067)</p>

<p><b>Other Partner :</b> Harish Vinod Tale (M1067)</p>

<p><b>Team Leader :</b> Guneet (S1002)</p>

<p><b>Period End:</b> November 03,2024</p>

<p>In reference to the assignment allocated, kindly <b>click on “Click here” button below</b> to acknowledge and e-sign the <b>Independence</b> for the assignment. Please note that an individual should be independent of the <b>client</b>.</p>

<p> </p>

<p><a href="https://vsademo.capitall.io/independence/create/MNA100034" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Click here </a>to acknowledge and e-sign your <b>Independence.</b></p>

<p> </p>

<p>Any matter impacting the <b>independence</b> of an individual with respect to the <b>client</b> shall be reported to the Engagement Partner immediately.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Thanks!</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

