    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>1.When selecting an employee name, start date, and end date, the client wants to check the joining date. If the start date is before the joining date, a warning message should appear: "You cannot select a date before the joining date.</p>

<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.Click on 'Attendance tab,<br/>
4.click on 'fill data and click search button'</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

