        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>1.If a user does not submit their timesheet continuously for one month, the attendance record should reflect this.</p>

<p>Expected result: On the first day of the month, attendance records will be created for all active team members.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

