    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>The user should not create duplicate assignments when clicking the submit button multiple times.</p>

<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Client/Assignmnet' dropdown.<br/>
2.Click on 'Add Assignment.<br/>
after that please enter all date and click on submit button.</p>

<p><b>Role:</b> Partner &amp; Admin</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
