    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>1.The client wants to display a popup message when clicking on the "View Details" text in the Reason and Remark columns on the Apply Leave and Timesheet Request Listing pages.</p>

<ol>
	<li>Check using Admin.partner,manager and staff id .</li>
</ol>


<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.click on 'Apply leave'</p>



<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.click on 'revert leave'</p>



<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.click on 'timesheet request list'</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
