    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>When a user is filling out their timesheet, the timesheet is automatically being filled for the date '11-12-2023'. A validation message appears stating that the timesheet submission failed due to missing dates: "Timesheet Submit Failed. Missing dates: 2023-12-12, 2023-12-13, 2023-12-14, 2023-12-15, 2023-12-16."</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

