    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Re-join date → 21/07/2024<br/>
If an employee applies for leave before their rejoining date of 21/07/2024 and then tries to fill  their timesheet after rejoining date, then  a validation error occurs states that the timesheet for the week of the applied leave must also be filled. </p>
<ul>
	<li>and when a user tries to fill in a timesheet before their rejoining date (21-07-2024), a validation message appears stating: 'You cannot fill in the timesheet before your rejoining date: 21-07-2024'.</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

