        <tr id="comment-body-15948"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>As per the client's discussion,</p>

<ul>
	<li>If a new assignment is created after promotion/rejoining → Show new staff code.</li>
	<li>If an old assignment (created before promotion/rejoining) → Show old staff code. <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" class="user-hover" rel="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" data-account-id="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" accountid="712020:43fffc2d-c757-4088-bfb7-edd6080cf348" rel="noreferrer">Pooja Kumari</a> cc <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Ae9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" data-account-id="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" accountid="712020:e9970c18-e725-4b9e-ae06-47a823431de3" rel="noreferrer">Simmi Puri</a> <a href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" class="user-hover" rel="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" data-account-id="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" accountid="712020:9fc66a27-a649-4528-8505-94383996f286" rel="noreferrer">Atishay Jain</a></li>
</ul>

        </td></tr>
