    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>on UDIN List section, after click plus button you can add udin documentation date from hare and this date will be show in udin list section</li>
</ul>


<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Client' dropdown.<br/>
2.Click on 'Assignment List'.<br/>
3.Click on Client name hyperlink, click on year and click on 'Assignment Id.<br/>
4.click on UDIN List:<br/>
5.click on plus button </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
