    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ul>
	<li>client want to attachment file on timesheet request create form</li>
</ul>


<p>Steps:-<br/>
1.Navigate to the application<br/>
2.Click on 'Human resoursec' dropdown.<br/>
3.Click on 'Timesheet dropdown and navigate to 'my timesheet.<br/>
4.click on 'Add Timesheet Request'</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
