    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-11584"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="712020:eb68ebac-b329-4587-a08d-fcf440d9d893"
                id="word_commented_712020:eb68ebac-b329-4587-a08d-fcf440d9d893"
                href="https://capitallio.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aeb68ebac-b329-4587-a08d-fcf440d9d893">
                    Manoj (Inactive)
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">08/Jul/24</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-11584"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>In the 'Attachment' field, users can upload any type of file without a size limit. However, when I try to upload a 10MB file, it takes 10 minutes to complete the upload.</p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
